-- The circulars' root (MMS-521): every circular that speaks to an item of
-- the shared vocabulary — the owners' circulars of תשס"ט and תש"ע on the 2008
-- supplement, and the owners' yearly employment circulars from תש"ף/1 on
-- the role allowances, the special-education kindergartens' among them (MMS-548) — (l4/lib/vocabulary.l4), the instruments it
-- includes (each describes itself in its own file), and what each claims
-- for a case. It is a `collection root` (l4/lib/precedence.l4) and applies
-- the circulars' own precedence: the later circular replaces the earlier on
-- the same point. The root (l4/lib/root.l4) sets this collection's ruling
-- against the takanon's and the agreements'.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT precedence
IMPORT `2008-09_tashsat_03`
IMPORT `2009-10_tasha_02`
IMPORT `2019-20_tashaf_01`
IMPORT `2020-21_tashpa_01`
IMPORT `2021-22_tashpab_02`
IMPORT `2022-23_tashpag_02`
IMPORT `2023-24_tashpad_01`
IMPORT `2023-24_tashpad_02`
IMPORT `2024-25_tashpah_01`
IMPORT `2025-26_tashpo_01`
IMPORT `2023-24_tashpad_03`
IMPORT `2024-25_tashpah_02`
IMPORT `2025-26_tashpo_02`

§ `שורש החוזרים — מה החוזרים אומרים על כל פריט`

§§ `המסמכים`

-- Each instrument describes itself in its own file (an `instrument` record
-- of the shared vocabulary). This root includes the circulars:
`the circulars' instruments` MEANS
    LIST `circular תשס"ט/3`, `circular תש"ע/2`,
         `circular תש"ף/1`,
         `circular תשפ"א/1`,
         `circular תשפ"ב/2`,
         `circular תשפ"ג/2`,
         `circular תשפ"ד/1`,
         `circular תשפ"ד/2`,
         `circular תשפ"ה/1`,
         `circular תשפ"ו/1`,
         `circular תשפ"ד/3`,
         `circular תשפ"ה/2`,
         `circular תשפ"ו/2`

§§ `מה החוזרים אומרים, לפי פריט`

GIVEN i IS A `pay item`, c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A LIST OF `claim`
DECIDE `the circulars' claims on` i c IS
    CONSIDER i
    WHEN `the 2008 public-sector supplement` THEN
        catMaybes (LIST `the claim of` `circular תשס"ט/3` (`the 2008 supplement according to circular תשס"ט/3` c),
                        `the claim of` `circular תש"ע/2` (`the 2008 supplement according to circular תש"ע/2` c))
    WHEN `the pedagogical coordinator's allowance rate` THEN
        catMaybes (LIST `the claim of` `circular תש"ף/1` (`the pedagogical coordinator's rate according to circular תש"ף/1` c),
                        `the claim of` `circular תשפ"א/1` (`the pedagogical coordinator's rate according to circular תשפ"א/1` c),
                        `the claim of` `circular תשפ"ב/2` (`the pedagogical coordinator's rate according to circular תשפ"ב/2` c),
                        `the claim of` `circular תשפ"ג/2` (`the pedagogical coordinator's rate according to circular תשפ"ג/2` c),
                        `the claim of` `circular תשפ"ד/1` (`the pedagogical coordinator's rate according to circular תשפ"ד/1` c),
                        `the claim of` `circular תשפ"ד/2` (`the pedagogical coordinator's rate according to circular תשפ"ד/2` c),
                        `the claim of` `circular תשפ"ה/1` (`the pedagogical coordinator's rate according to circular תשפ"ה/1` c),
                        `the claim of` `circular תשפ"ו/1` (`the pedagogical coordinator's rate according to circular תשפ"ו/1` c))
    WHEN `the mentor's allowance rate` THEN
        catMaybes (LIST `the claim of` `circular תש"ף/1` (`the mentor's rate according to circular תש"ף/1` c),
                        `the claim of` `circular תשפ"א/1` (`the mentor's rate according to circular תשפ"א/1` c),
                        `the claim of` `circular תשפ"ב/2` (`the mentor's rate according to circular תשפ"ב/2` c),
                        `the claim of` `circular תשפ"ג/2` (`the mentor's rate according to circular תשפ"ג/2` c),
                        `the claim of` `circular תשפ"ד/1` (`the mentor's rate according to circular תשפ"ד/1` c),
                        `the claim of` `circular תשפ"ד/2` (`the mentor's rate according to circular תשפ"ד/2` c),
                        `the claim of` `circular תשפ"ה/1` (`the mentor's rate according to circular תשפ"ה/1` c),
                        `the claim of` `circular תשפ"ו/1` (`the mentor's rate according to circular תשפ"ו/1` c),
                        `the claim of` `circular תשפ"ד/3` (`the mentor's rate according to circular תשפ"ד/3` c),
                        `the claim of` `circular תשפ"ה/2` (`the mentor's rate according to circular תשפ"ה/2` c),
                        `the claim of` `circular תשפ"ו/2` (`the mentor's rate according to circular תשפ"ו/2` c))
    WHEN `the junior-division head's allowance` THEN
        catMaybes (LIST `the claim of` `circular תשפ"ד/1` (`the junior-division head's allowance according to circular תשפ"ד/1` c),
                        `the claim of` `circular תשפ"ד/2` (`the junior-division head's allowance according to circular תשפ"ד/2` c),
                        `the claim of` `circular תשפ"ה/1` (`the junior-division head's allowance according to circular תשפ"ה/1` c),
                        `the claim of` `circular תשפ"ו/1` (`the junior-division head's allowance according to circular תשפ"ו/1` c))
    -- only תשפ"ו/1's "at most two" is encoded as a rule so far (MMS-552)
    WHEN `the role allowances counted` THEN
        catMaybes (LIST `the claim of` `circular תשפ"ו/1` (`the role allowances counted according to circular תשפ"ו/1` c))

§§ `חוזר מאוחר גובר על מוקדם`

GIVEN a IS A `claim`, b IS A `claim`
GIVETH A `claim`
DECIDE `the more recent circular's claim` a b IS
    IF DATE_SERIAL (b's `by`'s `issued`) GREATER THAN DATE_SERIAL (a's `by`'s `issued`) THEN b ELSE a

-- Among circulars that speak, the most recent replaces the others on the same
-- point (convention precedence.later-circular); one alone governs as the
-- only one that speaks.
GIVEN claims IS A LIST OF `claim`
GIVETH A MAYBE `ruling`
DECIDE `the ruling among circulars` claims IS
    CONSIDER claims
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING
    WHEN t FOLLOWED BY ts THEN
        JUST (`the ruling for`
                  (foldr (GIVEN c, acc YIELD `the more recent circular's claim` acc c) t ts)
                  (IF null ts THEN `the only instrument that speaks` ELSE `a later circular replaces an earlier one`))

`the circulars' root` MEANS
    `collection root` WITH
        `the collection`  IS "החוזרים לבעלויות"
        `its instruments` IS `the circulars' instruments`
        `what each says`  IS `the circulars' claims on`
        `its ruling`      IS (GIVEN i, c YIELD `the ruling among circulars` (`the circulars' claims on` i c))
